    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n4886" root="جأش" body-key="j">
    
      1 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">جَأَشَتْ نَفْسُهُ</span></b> , aor. 
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">جَاَ^َ</span></b> , <i>His soul rose,</i> or <i>heaved,
by reason of grief</i> or <i>fear;</i> (As, K;) a dial.
var. of <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">جَاشَتْ</span>, aor. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تَجِيشُ</span>. (TA.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  Also, both
of these, <i>His</i> (a coward's) <i>soul purposed flight:</i>
or <i>was frightened.</i> (TA in art. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">جيش</span>.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b3-  <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">جَأَشَ</span>
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">إِلَيْهِ</span>, aor. 
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">جَاَ^َ</span></b> , <i>He came, came forward,</i> or <i>advanced,
towards him.</i> (K.)

